starting version 133, the comilation of the iradina code is madeon linux
to compile for linux
use gcc with the makefile as it is
>make clean ; make

to compile for windows :
1/install
1.    Install a Cross-Compiler:
 sudo apt-get install mingw-w64
2. edit the makefile to change the value of $(CC)
CC = x86_64-w64-mingw32-

3.Compile as for linux :
make clean ; make
(this will do x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc example.c -o example.exe)
this will create a file iradina.exe which is to be renamed
mv iradina.exe ../iradinaCode/iradina_mingw64.exe (the name is historic/legacy).